      "message": "[warning] Line 170: 🟡 In the `[weak self]` nil branch, only the current callback’s `content` is cleaned up via `discardFile`, but previously loaded items stored in `loaded` are never discarded. If the panel is deallocated mid-load, temporary exported files from earlier callbacks can leak. When `self` is nil, also drain/cleanup any already-buffered `OutgoingMessage.Content` values from `loaded` (or centralize cleanup in a single completion path).",
